:211:`MarkdownEditor` keeps two explicit modes.\\\\ndesign\\\\\\\\releases\\\\\\\\0_0_2\\\\\\\\J_017_markdown_editor_data_sources.md:216:interface MarkdownEditorDataSourceProps extends MarkdownEditorPresentationProps {\\\\ndesign\\\\\\\\releases\\\\\\\\0_0_2\\\\\\\\J_017_markdown_editor_data_sources.md:220:    stateStore: MarkdownEditorStateStore\\\\ndesign\\\\\\\\releases\\\\\\\\0_0_2\\\\\\\\J_017_markdown_editor_data_sources.md:226:**Props mode** — only for transient local buffers (`new_card_dialog`, `action_agent_form`). `markdown` is mount-time initial content; external replacement still goes through `MarkdownEditorHandle.setMarkdown()`.\\\\ndesign\\\\\\\\releases\\\\\\\\0_0_2\\\\\\\\J_017_markdown_editor_data_sources.md:228:Presentation props unchanged: `flushOnBlur`, `stickyToolbar`, `hideToolbar`, `readOnly`, `overlayContainer`, `placeholders`, `toolbarContents`.\\\\ndesign\\\\\\\\releases\\\\\\\\0_0_2\\\\\\\\J_017_markdown_editor_data_sources.md:254:export class MarkdownEditorStateStore extends EventTarget {\\\\ndesign\\\\\\\\releases\\\\\\\\0_0_2\\\\\\\\J_017_markdown_editor_data_sources.md:298:`registerMarkdownEditorFlush` stays a set of per-instance callbacks; quit-time flush still flushes every mounted editor.\\\\ndesign\\\\\\\\releases\\\\\\\\0_0_2\\\\\\\\J_019_unify_open_document_drafts_and_save_state.md:37:- `MarkdownEditorStateStore` tracks one editor buffer while `ActionService` revisions and `CommitBatcher` separately track the same file through later save stages.\\\\ndesign\\\\\\\\releases\\\\\\\\0_0_2\\\\\\\\J_019_unify_open_document_drafts_and_save_state.md:60:`MarkdownEditor` reports edits through the active document/data source but never declares a persisted document clean. Local transient editors without an `OpenDocument` may keep `onDirtyChange`; they are outside project-file save state.\\\\ndesign\\\\\\\\releases\\\\\\\\0_0_2\\\\\\\\J_019_unify_open_document_drafts_and_save_state.md:94:Remove `MarkdownEditorStateStore`, its props, instances