app\\\\\\\\src\\\\\\\\components\\\\\\\\editor\\\\\\\\markdown_editor_file_search.test.tsx:46).\\\\n\\\\nRequired correction shape:\\\\n\\\\n1. Local repository index must honor Git ignore rules; exclude `node_modules`, build output, caches.\\\\n2. Distinguish inactive query (`null`) from active empty query (`''`).\\\\n3. Cap or virtualize displayed results.\\\\n4. Avoid duplicate full-list scans.\\\\n5. Add real large-index regression test; stop mocking plugin in critical integration coverage.\\\\n\\\\nNo changes made.\\\\n\\\\n\\\",\\ndesign\\\\activity\\\\card__5cdae748-9597-4d29-8dc0-3d4b5df3aa7f.json:4152:          \\\"output\\\": \\\"{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"search\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"query\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"queries\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"site:tanstack.com/virtual latest React virtual documentation useVirtualizer dynamic measurement\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"site:github.com/bvaughn/react-window react-window latest React 19 virtualization README\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"site:npmjs.com/package/@tanstack/react-virtual @tanstack react virtual version\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"site:npmjs.com/package/react-window react-window version\\\\\\\"]}\\\",\\ndesign\\\\activity\\\\card__5cdae748-9597-4d29-8dc0-3d4b5df3aa7f.json:4187:          \\\"content\\\": \\\"Recommend `@tanstack/react-virtual`.\\\\n\\\\nWhy:\\\\n\\\\n- Headless. Keeps existing MUI `Paper`, `List`, `ListItemButton`, ARIA, and Lexical selection logic.\\\\n- Supports element-scoped popup scrolling through `useVirtualizer`.\\\\n- Supports measured row heights; useful when long repository paths wrap.\\\\n- `scrollToIndex(selectedIndex)` can keep keyboard-highlighted option mounted and visible.\\\\n- React 19 supported. Use `useFlushSync: false` per official React 19 guidance. [TanStack React docs](https://tanstack.com/virtual/latest/docs/framework/react/react-virtual)\\\\n- Current package: `3.14.8`. [npm](https://www.npmjs.com/package/%40tanstack/react-virtual)\\\\n\\\\nSuggested setup:\\\\n\\\\n```powershell\\\\nnpm install @tanstack/re